OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear spells at first
OL,7,Fbut cloud will soon increase from the
OL,8,Fwest with some outbreaks of rain
OL,9,Ffollowing from midnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FCloudy with rain and drizzle
OL,12,Fin the early morning. The rain will
OL,13,Fsoon clear with bright spells
OL,14,Fincreasing from the afternoon. Feeling
OL,15,Fwarm where the sun breaks through.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
