OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloud
OL,6,Fand rain will move in from the
OL,7,Fnorthwest Tuesday morning becoming
OL,8,Fheavy overnight and clearing early
OL,9,FWednesday. Dry start Thursday, further
OL,10,Frain and freshening winds from the
OL,11,Fnorthwest later.
